This repository contains a Colab notebook built around BioEmu2.

Portions of BioEmu2_Colab.ipynb are adapted from the usage examples of
https://github.com/microsoft/bioemu2:

    Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
    Licensed under the MIT License.

BioEmu2 itself is not included here. The notebook installs it from that
repository at run time, pinned to commit 6d1ca74, and downloads the model
weights from https://huggingface.co/microsoft/bioemu2, which are published
under the MIT License.

md_reference/ holds 21 frames of the 1KKL trajectories of the DynaBench dataset, seven from
each of its three 100 ns replicas with the first 20 ns of each discarded. They are included so
that the test run has something to compare against, and they are not covered by this
repository's MIT licence. Please cite:

    Barlas AB, Laurent B, Karaca E, Prévost C, Sacquin-Mora S. DynaBench: Dynamic data for the docking
    benchmark. Journal of Molecular Biology 438 (2026) 169650. doi:10.1016/j.jmb.2026.169650

The full trajectories are distributed at http://www-lbt.ibpc.fr/DynaBench on the MDposit
platform (INRIA node) of the Molecular Dynamics Data Bank.
